  "title": "Gnocchi",
  "description": "Gnocchi is easy to make with just three easy ingredients: mashed potato, flour and an egg — that's all you need to knead for gnocchi!",
  "authors": [
    "Anna"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-06-03T09:51:07-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-27T15:14:52-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT30M",
  "cook_time": "PT40M",
