    "Italian"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 potatoes, peeled",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 egg",
    "1 teaspoon kosher salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lcltWX7yh4Q0CXWm8DOGt-0jDG8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18465-gnocchi-ddmfs-3x4-ingredients-0368-c2a1eb28004d4217b18063ead0e68515.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18465/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes in a large saucepan and cover with 2 inches of salted water. Bring to a boil over high heat; reduce heat to medium-high and simmer, undisturbed, until tender but still firm, 25 to 30 minutes. Drain potatoes and place back in the pot to dry and cool slightly, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GBjQAXCDWjVNV_FuV29BFmaNpO0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18465-gnocchi-ddmfs-3x4-01-0371-61b3f274b30d4612b9adae501b6bacf3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18465/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "As soon as potatoes are cool enough to handle, peel potatoes by rubbing skins off with your hands. Pass peeled potatoes through a potato ricer into a large bowl (alternatively, mash until very smooth.) Let cool slightly, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q8-kd4rsUg7C94GjrtzB5DCYnlM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18465-gnocchi-ddmfs-3x4-02-0377-592b60f17fe04274969d707d699b57aa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18465/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold in flour, egg, and salt until flour is incorporated and dough starts to hold together. Transfer dough to a lightly floured surface and gently knead once or twice until mostly smooth (do not overwork).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y_wJLz8bCuZIRVooUe2Ul8E_FpU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18465-gnocchi-ddmfs-3x4-03-0383-d93ca31aa19349aebb299082af5653d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18465/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide dough into 4 even portions. Roll and shape each portions of the dough into long \"snakes,\" about ¾-inch in diameter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UaetCJg5RMyv4aN3PiLO7eyf0PY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18465-gnocchi-ddmfs-3x4-04-0389-53deabac8af047dea4e445969ca11a1c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18465/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut snakes into about 1/2-inch long pieces. (Optional: Roll each piece against the tines of a fork or a gnocchi board to make light ridges.) Transfer shaped gnocchi to a single layer on a parchment-lined baking sheet dusted with flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M4AUru2I8Q5Sntolc80fFuCB09c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18465-gnocchi-ddmfs-3x4-05-0392-54bacd5fcb684d738c4d25a48badc429.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18465/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil over high. Working in batches, drop in gnocchi and cook for 3 to 4 minutes or until gnocchi have risen to the top; transfer cooked gnocchi with a spider or slotted spoon to desired sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qXORJcC8oCYi9rzhQliQGM44QmM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18465-gnocchi-ddmfs-3x4-06-0407-bd394525069742b89dd925a7c9b0fa45.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18465/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GN5lNH6Fue3woxpEIF1oayFZ-hA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18465-gnocchi-ddmfs-3x4-0431-715927775cb747599c04b42bef952baa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18465/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
